  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/04/IMG_4172.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La actuaci&oacute;n ayer s&aacute;bado por la tarde-noche de la nueva orquesta local Ajedrez, que debutaba en Onda tras su inicio en la fiestas de la Magdalena de Castell&oacute;n, ha cerrado la V Pascua Sonora, exitosa como las anteriores.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sonoraultimdissabte/img_4161.jpg\" alt=\"img_4161\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sonoraultimdissabte/img_4162.jpg\" alt=\"img_4162\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sonoraultimdissabte/img_4163.jpg\" alt=\"img_4163\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sonoraultimdissabte/img_4164.jpg\" alt=\"img_4164\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sonoraultimdissabte/img_4165.jpg\" alt=\"img_4165\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sonoraultimdissabte/img_4166.jpg\" alt=\"img_4166\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sonoraultimdissabte/img_4167.jpg\" alt=\"img_4167\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sonoraultimdissabte/img_4168.jpg\" alt=\"img_4168\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sonoraultimdissabte/img_4169.jpg\" alt=\"img_4169\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sonoraultimdissabte/img_4170.jpg\" alt=\"img_41